al)","Canst thou help me?"],["can you help me? (formal)","Will it please you to help me?"],["hi (informal)","What ho"],["good morning (formal)","God give you good morrow"],["see you (informal)","Till anon"],["goodbye (formal)","God be with you"]],"note":"\"Thou\" is for one friend, a child or an inferior. \"You\" is polite and is also the plural. A king says \"thou\" to a servant; a servant must say \"you\" to a king."},{"id":"survival","title":"Survival","items":[["I do not understand","I understand thee not"],["I understand","I understand thee"],["I do not know","I know not"],["do you speak English?","Dost thou speak English?"],["I speak a little Shakespearean English","I speak somewhat of this tongue"],["speak slowly, please","Speak slowly, I pray thee"],["can you repeat that?","Say it once more, I pray thee"],["how do you say... in Shakespearean English?","How is... said in this tongue?"],["what does... mean?","What meaneth...?"],["please write it down","Write it down, I pray thee"],["help!","Help, ho"],["I am lost","I have lost my way"],["I need help","I have need of help"]]},{"id":"getting-around","title":"Getting around","items":[["where is...?","Where is...?"],["where is the toilet?","Where is the privy?"],["where is the station?","Where is the coaching inn?"],["turn left","Turn to the left hand"],["turn right","Turn to the right hand"],["straight ahead","Straight on"],["near","Nigh"],["far","Far"],["how far is it?","How far is it hence?"],["a ticket to London, please","A passage to London, I pray thee"],["what time does the train leave?","At what hour doth the coach depart?"],["how much is the ticket?","What is the fare?"],["to the airport, please","To the haven, I pray thee"],["stop here, please","Stay here, I pray thee"]]},{"id":"eating-out","title":"Eating out","items":[["a table for two, please","A board for two, prithee"],["the menu, please","What dishes have you, I pray thee?"],["I would like...","I would have..."],["I will have this","I will take this"],["water, please","Water, prithee"],["the bill, please","The reckoning, prithee"],["it is delicious","'Tis most savoury"],["I am hungry","I am hungry"],["I am thirsty","I am athirst"],["I am vegetarian","I eat no flesh"],["I am allergic to nuts","Nuts are poison to me"],["no meat, please","No flesh, I pray thee"],["another one, please","One more, I pray thee"]]},{"id":"shopping","title":"Shopping","items":[["how much is this?","What is the price of this?"],["it is too expensive","It is too dear"],["do you have a smaller size?","Have you one of lesser size?"],["I am just looking","I do but look"],["I will take it","I will take it"],["can I pay by card?","May I pay by bond?"],["cash","ready money"],["a bag, please","A bag, prithee"],["open","Open"],["closed","Shut"]]},{"id":"hotel-and-travel","title":"Hotel and travel","items":[["I have a reservation","I have bespoke a room"],["a room for one night","A chamber for one night"],["what time is breakfast?","When doth breakfast serve?"],["the key, please","The key, prithee"],["is there wifi?","Hath this inn wifi?"],["my passport","my passport"],["my luggage","my baggage"],["I would like to change money","I would change some money"]]},{"id":"health-and-emergency","title":"Health and emergency","items":[["I feel sick","I am sick"],["I need a doctor","I have need of a physician"],["call an ambulance","Send for a litter and a physician"],["it hurts here","It pains me here"],["I have a headache","My head aches"],["I have a fever","I am in a fever"],["where is the pharmacy?","Where is the apothecary?"],["call the police","Call the watch"],["my phone was stolen","My phone is stol'n"]]},{"id":"chatting","title":"Chatting","items":[["what do you do?","What is thy trade?"],["I am a student","I am a scholar"],["I am a teacher","I am a schoolmaster"],["I live in Tashkent","I dwell in Tashkent"],["how old are you?","How old art thou?"],["I am sixteen","I am sixteen years old"],["do you like football?","Dost thou love football?"],["I like music","I am fond of music"],["I love it","I love it well"],["what time is it?","What is't o'clock?"],["it is three o'clock","'Tis three o'clock"],["what is the date today?","What day o' the month is it?"],["I am happy","I am glad"],["I am tired","I am weary"]]},{"id":"useful-words","title":"Useful words","items":[["and","and"],["but","but"],["because","for"],["very","most"],["here","here"],["there","yonder"],["now","now"],["today","this day"],["tomorrow","tomorrow"],["yesterday","yesterday"],["always","ever"],["never","never"],["maybe","perchance"],["what","what"],["who","who"],["when","when"],["why","wherefore"],["how","how"],["which","which"]]},{"id":"in-the-classroom","title":"In the classroom","items":[["may I come in?","Have I leave to enter?"],["may I go to the toilet?","Have I leave to go to the privy?"],["I have a question","I have a question to ask"],["I do not know the answer","I know not the answer"],["I forgot my homework","I have forgot my task"],["sorry, I am late","Pardon me, I am come too late"],["please repeat the question","Repeat the question, I pray thee"],["what page are we on?","At what leaf are we?"],["open your books","Open your books"],["close your books","Shut your books"],["listen, please","Hark, I pray you"],["look at the board","Look upon the board"],["how do you spell it?","How is it spelt?"],["what does this word mean?","What meaneth this word?"],["I have finished","I have done"],["can I borrow a pen?","Lend me a quill, I pray thee"]]},{"id":"phone-and-internet","title":"Phone and internet","items":[["what is your phone number?","What is the number of thy phone?"],["my phone number is...","The number of my phone is..."],["can I use your phone?","May I use thy phone?"],["my battery is dead","My phone is spent of power"],["what is the wifi password?","What is the watchword to the wifi?"],["I will text you","I will send thee word"],["call me later","Call upon me anon"],["I have no signal","I have no signal"],["send me a message","S